{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a quiet neighborhood on Halloween night, where nothing is as it seems. <br><i>Trick or Truth?</i> is a story-driven, atmospheric walking simulator that blends exploration, puzzles, and mystery with a chilling seasonal theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Halloween Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Explore houses, streets, and hidden spots filled with seasonal details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery &amp; Exploration</strong> \u2013 Uncover clues, <strong>find hidden objects</strong>, interact with NPCs, and piece together hidden stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light Puzzle Elements</strong> \u2013 Simple but engaging challenges that enhance the narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Touches</strong> \u2013 A subtle, immersive tension without relying on jump scares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong> \u2013 Your <strong>in-game skills</strong> shape how the story concludes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy <strong>Halloween vibes, exploration, and narrative-driven experiences</strong>, <i>Trick or Truth?</i> will keep you curious until the final moment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085230/extras/a882e12050c5413d3532d7bced40a00f.avif?t=1760879416\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4085230?t=1760879416","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085230/cd838107d39523b5e51e41af6d4d823d9e0e2ec5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760879416","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085230/7a2d3133d9ddaa42fb015c0d651880ca92c56a7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760879416","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085230/7a2d3133d9ddaa42fb015c0d651880ca92c56a7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760879416","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a quiet neighborhood on Halloween night, where nothing is as it seems. <br><i>Trick or Truth?</i> is a story-driven, atmospheric walking simulator that blends exploration, puzzles, and mystery with a chilling seasonal theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Halloween Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Explore houses, streets, and hidden spots filled with seasonal details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery &amp; Exploration</strong> \u2013 Uncover clues, <strong>find hidden objects</strong>, interact with NPCs, and piece together hidden stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light Puzzle Elements</strong> \u2013 Simple but engaging challenges that enhance the narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Touches</strong> \u2013 A subtle, immersive tension without relying on jump scares.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong> \u2013 Your <strong>in-game skills</strong> shape how the story concludes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy <strong>Halloween vibes, exploration, and narrative-driven experiences</strong>, <i>Trick or Truth?</i> will keep you curious until the final moment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4085230/extras/a882e12050c5413d3532d7bced40a00f.avif?t=1760879416\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p>","developers":["MythWake Games"],"genres